cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jashwanth
    family-names: Mummalaneni
    affiliation: IIT Guwahati 2024
title: "Hawkes Process Calibration of Cryptocurrency Limit Order Book Data"
abstract: >
  Bivariate Sum-of-Exponentials Hawkes calibration on Binance BTC/USDT and
  ETH/USDT market order flow (144-145 one-hour windows, May 2026). Key
  findings: UTC-driven intraday seasonality in self-excitation (η 9-12%
  higher at NYSE open, OLS R²=0.35, p<0.001); η-RV Spearman correlation
  ρ=0.84; 91-97% GOF improvement via 100µs sweep-fill aggregation across
  all UTC hours.
version: "1.0.0"
